</code></pre></div></div></div></div><div class="code-block-fade-overlay print:hidden" data-fade-overlay="true" aria-hidden="true" style="--fade-color-light:#ffffff;--fade-color-dark:#0B0C0E"></div></div></div></div></div><div id="panel-mercury-voice-1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="mercury-voice" tabindex="0" class="prose dark:prose-invert overflow-x-auto [&amp;_[data-table-wrapper]]:![--page-padding:0px] [&amp;_[role=&quot;listitem&quot;]]:pl-4 -ml-4 pl-4 [&amp;&gt;:first-child:not(p)]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;:first-child:not(p)_img]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;:first-child[data-table-wrapper]]:pt-0! hidden" data-component-part="tab-content"><span data-as="p">A diffusion LLM tuned for voice agents. It reasons, calls tools, returns structured outputs, and follows long system prompts while keeping latency low enough for natural conversation.</span><span data-as="p">Mercury Voice is available to enterprise customers through the OpenAI-compatible Inception API, and works with LiveKit, Pipecat, Vapi, Retell, or your own voice stack. It supports <code>low</code>, <code>medium</code>, and <code>high</code> reasoning effort. Temperature is adjustable from 0.5 to 1.0.</span><span data-as="p">Mercury 3 is <strong>50% off at launch</strong>: $0.10 per million input tokens and $0.35 per million output tokens (regularly $0.20 and $0.70).</span><div class="card block font-normal group relative my-2 ring-2 ring-transparent rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-background-dark border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 overflow-hidden w-full cursor-pointer hover:border-primary! dark:hover:border-primary-light!" aria-labelledby="_R_2575deehkd74t9_" tabindex="0" role="link"><div class="px-6 py-5 relative flex items-center gap-x-4" data-component-part="card-content-container"><div class="absolute text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 group-hover:text-primary dark:group-hover:text-primary-light top-5 right-5 hidden"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="m-0.5 size-3 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-ExternalLink"></use></svg></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="size-6 fill-gray-800 dark:fill-gray-100 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-6" data-component-part="card-icon"><svg class="forced-colors:forced-color-adjust-none forced-colors:bg-[color:CanvasText]! size-6 m-0! shrink-0 bg-primary dark:bg-primary-light" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/regular/microphone.svg&quot;);-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/regular/microphone.svg&quot;);mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center"></svg></div><div class="w-full"><h2 id="_R_2575deehkd74t9_" class="not-prose font-semibold text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white" contentEditable="false" data-component-part="card-title">Get access to Mercury Voice</h2><div id="_R_2575deehkd74t9H1_" class="prose font-normal text-base text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-6 mt-0" data-component-part="card-content"><span data-as="p">Contact <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#becddfd2dbcdfed7d0dddbcecad7d1d0d2dfdccd90dfd7" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="740715181107341d1a171104001d1b1a181516075a151d">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> to enable Mercury Voice for your organization.</span></div></div></div></div></div><div id="panel-mercury-decide-2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="mercury-decide" tabindex="0" class="prose dark:prose-invert overflow-x-auto [&amp;_[data-table-wrapper]]:![--page-padding:0px] [&amp;_[role=&quot;listitem&quot;]]:pl-4 -ml-4 pl-4 [&amp;&gt;:first-child:not(p)]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;:first-child:not(p)_img]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;:first-child[data-table-wrapper]]:pt-0! hidden" data-component-part="tab-content"><span data-as="p">Evaluate named questions against shared context with <code>mercury-decide</code> at <code>v1/decisions</code>. Get binary probabilities, categorical choices, or ordinal scores with typed answers, or <a href="/capabilities/extract" class="link">extract</a> exact spans of the input text.</span><span data-as="p">Only input tokens are billed, at <strong>$0.02 per million tokens</strong> (50% off the regular $0.04 price). Output tokens are reported but not charged. This endpoint does not support chat completions, streaming, or tool calling.</span><div class="card block font-normal group relative my-2 ring-2 ring-transparent rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-background-dark border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 overflow-hidden w-full cursor-pointer hover:border-primary! dark:hover:border-primary-light!" aria-labelledby="_R_1n75deehkd74t9_" tabindex="0" role="link"><div class="px-6 py-5 relative flex items-center gap-x-4" data-component-part="card-content-container"><div class="absolute text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 group-hover:text-primary dark:group-hover:text-primary-light top-5 right-5 hidden"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="m-0.5 size-3 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-ExternalLink"></use></svg></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="size-6 fill-gray-800 dark:fill-gray-100 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-6" data-component-part="card-icon"><svg class="forced-colors:forced-color-adjust-none forced-colors:bg-[color:CanvasText]! size-6 m-0! shrink-0 bg-primary dark:bg-primary-light" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/regular/list-check.svg&quot;);-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/regular/list-check.svg&quot;);mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center"></svg></div><div class="w-full"><h2 id="_R_1n75deehkd74t9_" class="not-prose font-semibold text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white" contentEditable="false" data-component-part